# What a container build does not need from the checkout. The Dockerfiles copy
# `rust/` and `vendor/`; without this file Docker first ships every build
# directory under them to the daemon, which on a developer's machine is tens
# of gigabytes and most of the build time.
**/target
.git
cpp/build
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
dist
vendor-crates
.cargo
# Secrets never enter an image.
*.key
*.seed
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
*.packet.tar
